Sec. 30.
Minnesota Statutes 2024, section 342.42, subdivision 7, is amended to read:

Subd. 7.
Nonemployee passengers prohibited.
Only a cannabis worker employed by or contracted with the cannabis delivery service and who is at least 25 years of age may transport cannabis flower, cannabis products, lower-potency hemp edibles, and hemp-derived consumer products. All passengers in a cannabis delivery service vehicle must be cannabis workers employed by or contracted with the cannabis delivery service.

